*: a cref in a slot, a cursor-cell iref in a value, a\n164:  and a `:cursor-cell-body` references only a stream (content) and a position\n165:  (data), so no cursor cell closes a cycle. The receiver still checks\n189:| `[:cursor-cell C]` | a reference to the identity cursor cell `C` |\n258:bytes of the sort key *as spelled in the emitted row*, cursor-cell numbers\n265:code address, `M` a manifest address, `P` a parked id, `C` a cursor-cell id,\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
